Date:   Mon Mar 30 18:23:55 2026 +0800

    feat(interpreter): add signal accumulation, summarization, and missing fields detection
    
    - Add SignalAccumulator for incremental context building across turns
    - Add Summarizer for conversation history compression
    - Add MissingFieldsDetector for identifying incomplete extraction signals
    - Refactor extractor to support accumulated signals and confidence scoring
    - Add ExtractionResult domain model with validation
    - Add InterpreterRequest model for structured input
    - Simplify interpreter rules by removing redundant logic
    - Update prompts to support new extraction workflow

